  <item>
    <title>联盟营销，品牌出海最后的流量洼地。</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6819788647ebeede7ef4d613</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6819788647ebeede7ef4d613</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 06 May 2025 02:53:05 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播: 圣总(公众号：圣总聊出海)</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：Angela| Affiliate Marketing（联盟营销）专家</span></p><span></span><p><span>《一人出海》听友群正式开放，欢迎+v: yztfc123。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="90">1:30</a>: 什么是联盟营销？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="269">4:29</a>：品牌方如何开始联盟营销？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="426">7:06</a>：联盟营销合作伙伴类型？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1087">18:07</a>：成功案例分享。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1347">22:27</a>：联盟营销的预算和运营周期？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1570">26:10</a>：如何找到高转化的合作伙伴？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1813">30:13</a>：中国出海品牌的常见误区？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2258">37:38</a>：如何看待TikTok联盟营销？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2445">40:45</a>：联盟营销行业的新趋势？</span></p><span></span><p><span>Angela 拥有6 年以上海外市场经验，是英国专业联盟营销Agency 的Affiliate Marketing Manager，长期服务于美妆、时尚、家居、旅游、金融等多个行业的欧美一线品牌。曾在欧洲最大美妆电商Lookfantastic 担任联盟营销经理，具备品牌方与代理方的双重实战视角。</span></p><span></span><p><span>她毕业于英国曼彻斯特大学商学院市场营销硕士，常驻伦敦，擅长结合国际视野与本地资源，帮助中国品牌在海外市场快速搭建成熟、高效的联盟营销体系。</span></p><span></span><p><span>📄 服务介绍Deck</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://gamma.app/docs/Weivy-Deck-Simplify-u1112xgwqi8yv4l" data-url="https://gamma.app/docs/Weivy-Deck-Simplify-u1112xgwqi8yv4l"><span>gamma.app</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>📱 微信联系Angela（备注“出海101” 欢迎交流）：zhangsongwei28_</span></p><span></span><p><span>📌 小红书关注 “Angela说出海营销” 获取更多案例与干货分享</span></p><span></span><p><span>🔗 提到的Affiliates 合作方简介：</span></p><span></span><p><span>• LTK（LikeToKnowIt）</span></p><span></span><p><span>全球最大的内容型联盟网络之一，专注于通过博主/网红驱动销售，适合时尚、美妆、生活方式品牌。</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.shopltk.com/" data-url="https://www.shopltk.com/"><span>www.shopltk.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>• TopCashback</span></p><span></span><p><span>英国最主流的返现平台，拥有大量忠实用户，覆盖广泛品类。</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.topcashback.co.uk/" data-url="https://www.topcashback.co.uk/"><span>www.topcashback.co.uk</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>• Footy.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>垂直类体育装备比价和导购平台，适合运动品牌或足球周边产品。</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.footy.com/" data-url="https://www.footy.com/"><span>www.footy.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>• Reach PLC</span></p><span></span><p><span>英国最大新闻出版集团之一，旗下媒体包括《镜报》《曼晚》，支持内容型广告与联盟导流。</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.reachplc.com/" data-url="https://www.reachplc.com/"><span>www.reachplc.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>• British AirwaysShopping Portal</span></p><span></span><p><span>通过积分激励用户购买，适合希望进入高净值旅客人群的品牌。</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.shopping.ba.com/" data-url="https://www.shopping.ba.com/"><span>www.shopping.ba.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>• Blue Light Card</span></p><span></span><p><span>面向英国 NHS、军警、公职人员等群体的专属折扣平台，转化率高、用户粘性强。</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bluelightcard.co.uk/" data-url="https://www.bluelightcard.co.uk/"><span>www.bluelightcard.co.uk</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>• Netmums</span></p><span></span><p><span>英国家庭与母婴内容社区，适合婴童、家居、食品类品牌投放。</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.netmums.com/" data-url="https://www.netmums.com/"><span>www.netmums.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>• Rakuten Cashback</span></p><span></span><p><span>全球联盟网络巨头，提供返现和积分渠道，覆盖全球用户。</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.rakuten.com/" data-url="https://www.rakuten.com/"><span>www.rakuten.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>• Skimlinks</span></p><span></span><p><span>内容变现平台，可将媒体、博客中的链接自动转为联盟链接，适合资讯型网站或品牌投放内容营销。</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.skimlinks.com/" data-url="https://www.skimlinks.com/"><span>www.skimlinks.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><spa